#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When enabled, the selected Auto Scale Option determines which limits RRDtool uses: --alt-autoscale ignores both limits, --alt-autoscale-max keeps the lower limit, --alt-autoscale-min keeps the upper limit, and --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits) keeps both limits. When disabled, the configured lower and upper limits are used directly. Rigid Boundaries controls whether values outside those limits expand the graph range."
msgstr "Rehefa alefa, ny Safidy fandanjana mandeha ho azy voafidy no mamaritra izay fetra ampiasain'ny RRDtool: ny --alt-autoscale dia tsy miraharaha ireo fetra roa, ny --alt-autoscale-max dia mitazona ny fetra ambany, ny --alt-autoscale-min dia mitazona ny fetra ambony, ary ny --alt-autoscale (manaiky ireo fetra roa) dia mitazona ireo fetra roa. Rehefa tsy alefa dia ampiasaina mivantana ireo fetra ambany sy ambony voaomana. Ny Fetra hentitra no mifehy raha manitatra ny sahan'ny kisary ny sanda ivelan'ireo fetra ireo."

