#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Kadupul handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Kadupul.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against an LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHP's LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Kadupul resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Fanamarinana Fidirana Tafiditra Anaty (Built-in Authentication)</i> - i Kadupul no mitantana ny fanamarinana ny mpampiasa, izay mamela anao hamorona mpampiasa sy hanome azy ireo zo amin'ny faritra samihafa ao anatin'i Kadupul.<br><br><i>Fanamarinana Fidirana Tsotra Web (Web Basic Authentication)</i> - Ny lohamilina web no mitantana ny fanamarinana. Ny mpampiasa dia azo ampiana na foronina ho azy amin'ny fidirana voalohany raha voafaritra ny Mpampiasa Lasitra, raha tsy izany dia ny fahazoan-dalan'ny vahiny voafaritra no hampiasaina.<br><br><i>Fanamarinana Fidirana LDAP (LDAP Authentication)</i> - Mamela ny fanamarinana amin'ny alalan'ny lohamilina LDAP. Ny mpampiasa dia hoforonina ho azy amin'ny fidirana voalohany raha voafaritra ny Mpampiasa Lasitra, raha tsy izany dia ny fahazoan-dalan'ny vahiny voafaritra no hampiasaina.  Raha tsy mandeha ny maodely LDAP an'ny PHP, tsy hiseho ho safidy azo fidina ny Fanamarinana Fidirana LDAP.<br><br><i>Fanamarinana Fidirana Sehatra LDAP/AD Maromaro (Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication)</i> - Mamela ny mpitantana hanohana vondrona samihafa maromaro avy amin'ny lahatahiry LDAP/AD samihafa hiditra amin'ny loharanon'i Kadupul.  Toy ny Fanamarinana Fidirana LDAP ihany, ilaina ny maodely PHP LDAP mba hampiasana ity fomba ity.</blockquote>"

