#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Historically, Kadupul administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Kadupul Graphs.  In earlier versions of Kadupul, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Kadupul, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Kadupul restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Kadupul continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Tamin'ny taloha, ny mpitantana an'i Kadupul dia namorona Fomba Fampidirana Angon-drakitra tsotra izay nahitana baiko toy ny \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" mba hanehoana sanda ara-isa hampiasaina ao amin'ny Kisarin'i Kadupul.  Tamin'ireo kinova teo aloha an'i Kadupul dia navela izany.  Na izany aza, fomba fanao tsy azo antoka izany satria varavarana ahafahan'ny mpampiasa avy any ivelany mamoaka Lasitra Angon-drakitra tsy azo antoka.  Ao amin'ny Kadupul maoderina dia tokony hohalavirina ny karazana fomba fanao toy izany.  Na izany aza, manome ity safidy ity izahay raha manana Fomba Fampidirana Angon-drakitra taloha ianao izay ahitana ireo Tarehin-tsoratra Manokana (Meta Characters) tsy azo antoka ireo ary mbola tsy navadika ho soratra baiko (scripts) eo an-toerana ao amin'ny lahatahiry 'scripts'.  Rehefa tsy voamarika ity safidy ity, i Kadupul dia mametra ireo tarehin-tsoratra manokana fomba shell toy ny famantarana teny miverina, fonon-teny miolakolaka, tsipika mitsangana, tsipika mirona miankavia, ary backticks.  Manohy mamela ny famantarana lehibe noho sy kely noho i Kadupul ho an'ny zavatra toy ny <path_cacti> sy ho an'ny masontsivana fampidirana, saingy raha tsy voamarika ity safidy ity dia izay ihany no fetran'ny fampiasana azy ireo."

