#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Kadupul 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Ny Threads mahazatra avela isaky ny dingana.  FANAMARIHANA: Manomboka amin'ny Kadupul 1.2+, ity fikirana ity dia tazonina ao amin'ny Mpanangon-drakitra, ary fametrahana mialoha (Preset) fotsiny izany.  Ny fampiasana isa ambony kokoa rehefa mampiasa Spine dia hanatsara ny fahaiza-miasa.  Na izany aza, ataovy izay hahazoana antoka fa manana fifandraisana MySQL/MariaDB ampy ianao hanohanana ity kajy manaraka ity: fifandraisana = mpanangon-drakitra * dingana * (threads + lohamilina script).  Tsy maintsy ataonao azo antoka ihany koa fa manana fifandraisana ambiny ampy ho an'ny fifandraisana fidiran'ny mpampiasa ianao."

