msgstr "Ny isan'ny fizotry ny lohamilina script miaraka mandeha isaky ny fizotry ny spine. Ekena ny sanda eo anelanelan'ny 1 sy 15. Hanampy ity masontsivana ity raha mandefa thread maromaro sy script lohamilina script ianao ary manan-kery ho an'ny Mpanangona Angon-drakitra spine ihany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of consecutive hours that represent the hourly average.  Keep in mind that a setting too high can result in very large memory tables"
msgstr "Ny isan'ny ora mifanesy izay maneho ny salan'isa isan'ora. Tadidio fa ny fikirana avo loatra dia mety hiteraka tabilao fitadidiana tena lehibe"

