msgstr "Fikiran'ny endrika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Misy fomba fanoloana telo. Ny fomba voalohany dia manolo ny fiakarana tampoka amin'ny salanisan'ilay loharanon-drakitra resahina. Ny fomba faharoa dia manolo ny fiakarana tampoka amin'ny 'NaN'. Ny farany dia manolo ny fiakarana tampoka amin'ny sanda tsara farany hita."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Misy fomba fanesorana roa. Ny voalohany, Fiviliana Manara-penitra, dia manala izay santionany mihoatra na latsaka amin'ny isa X amin'ny fiviliana manara-penitra raha oharina amin'ny salanisan'ny santionany. Ny fomba faharoa, Variance, dia manala izay santionany mihoatra X% amin'ny salanisan'ny Variance. Ny fomba Variance dia mandray an-tanana ny isan'ny 'santionany maningana'. Ireo dia santionany maningana, toy ny fiakarana tampoka, izay mila esorina amin'ny kajy ny Salanisan'ny Variance."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Tazonina eo amin'ny ambaratongan'ny Mpanangona angona (Data Collector) ireto fikirana ireto. Sanda mahazatra ampiasaina amin'ny famoronana voalohany Mpanangona angona ihany ny sanda eto."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is an Email account used for sending a test message to ensure everything is working properly."
msgstr "Ity dia kaonty mailaka ampiasaina handefasana hafatra fanandramana mba hahazoana antoka fa mandeha tsara ny zava-drehetra."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is how many characters will be allowed before a line in the Email is automatically word wrapped. (0 = Disabled)"
msgstr "Ity no isan'ny tarehintsoratra azo ekena alohan'ny hampidinana ho azy ny andalana ao amin'ny mailaka. (0 = Tsy alefa)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Ity no adiresy mailaka izay hiseho ho mpampandefa ny mailaka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "Ity no tena anarana izay hiseho ho mpampandefa ny mailaka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the directory where RRDfiles are <strong>moved</strong> for archiving"
msgstr "Ity no lahatahiry <strong>amindrana</strong> ireo rakitra RRD mba hitehirizana azy anaty arisiva"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the hostname/IP of the SMTP Server you will send the Email to. For failover, separate your hosts using a semi-colon."
msgstr "Ity no anaran'ny mpizara na IP an'ny Mpizara SMTP handefasanao ny mailaka. Ho an'ny fanoloana raha misy tsy fahatomombanana (failover), saraho amin'ny teboka sy faingo ny mpizara."

