msgid "When disabled, Kadupul Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Rehefa tsy alefa, tsy hamorona Kisary mavitrika ny Fampandehanana ho azy (Automation) an'i Kadupul.  Ilaina izany rehefa manitsy ny fikirana Fitaovana mba hisorohana ny famoronana Kisary vaovao isaky ny mitahiry singa iray ianao.  Mbola ho azo atao ihany ny miantso ny Fitsipika Fampandehanana ho azy amin'ny tanana."

