#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MariaDB less than 10.5.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max of the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "Ny %s dia hizara ny innodb_buffer_pool ho faritra fitadidiana mba hanatsarana ny fahombiazana ho an'ny kinova MariaDB latsaky ny 10.5. Ny sanda ambony indrindra dia 64, saingy tsy tokony hihoatra ny isan'ny fototra/kofehy CPU. Rehefa latsaky ny 1GB ny innodb_buffer_pool-nao dia tokony hampiasa ny haben'ny tahiry zaraina 128MB ianao. Tohizo ny fampiasana ity raikipohy ity hatramin'ny isan'ny fototra CPU ambony indrindra na 64."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MySQL up to and including MySQL 8.0.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max of the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "Ny %s dia hizara ny innodb_buffer_pool ho faritra fitadidiana mba hanatsarana ny fahombiazana ho an'ny kinova MySQL hatramin'ny MySQL 8.0. Ny sanda ambony indrindra dia 64, saingy tsy tokony hihoatra ny isan'ny fototra/kofehy CPU. Rehefa latsaky ny 1GB ny innodb_buffer_pool-nao dia tokony hampiasa ny haben'ny tahiry zaraina 128MB ianao. Tohizo ny fampiasana ity raikipohy ity hatramin'ny isan'ny fototra CPU ambony indrindra na 64."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "A minimum of %s m execution time"
msgstr "Fotoana fanatanterahana farany ambany %s m"

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "A minimum of %s memory limit"
msgstr "Fetra fitadidiana farany ambany %s"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "A valid timezone that matches MySQL and the system"
msgstr "Faritra ora manan-kery mifanaraka amin'ny MySQL sy ny rafitra"

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "As of %s %s, you can control how often %s flushes transactions to disk.  The default is 1 second, but in high I/O systems setting to a value greater than 1 can allow disk I/O to be more sequential"
msgstr "Manomboka amin'ny %s %s dia azonao fehezina ny matetika fanadiovan'ny %s ny fifanakalozana mankany amin'ny kapila. 1 segondra no mahazatra, fa amin'ny rafitra manana I/O avo dia ny fametrahana sanda mihoatra ny 1 dia afaka mamela ny I/O kapila hilahatra tsara kokoa"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Comments"
msgstr "Fanamarihana"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Current Value"
msgstr "Sanda ankehitriny"

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Depending on the number of logins and use of spine data collector, %s will need many connections.  The calculation for spine is: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), then you must leave headroom for user connections, which will change depending on the number of concurrent login accounts."
msgstr "Arakaraka ny isan'ny fidirana sy ny fampiasana ny mpanangon-drakitra Spine dia mila fifandraisana maro ny %s. Ny kajy ho an'ny Spine dia: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), ary tsy maintsy mamela toerana malalaka ho an'ny fifandraisan'ny mpampiasa ianao, izay miovaova arakaraka ny isan'ny kaonty miditra miaraka."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "If using the Kadupul Performance Booster and choosing a memory storage engine, you have to be careful to flush your Performance Booster buffer before the system runs out of memory table space.  This is done two ways, first reducing the size of your output column to just the right size.  This column is in the tables poller_output, and poller_output_boost.  The second thing you can do is allocate more memory to memory tables.  We have arbitrarily chosen a recommended value of 10%% of system memory, but if you are using SSD disk drives, or have a smaller system, you may ignore this recommendation or choose a different storage engine.  You may see the expected consumption of the Performance Booster tables under Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."
msgstr "Raha mampiasa ny Kadupul Performance Booster ianao ary misafidy motera fitahirizana ao amin'ny tadidy, dia mila mitandrina ianao mba hanadio ny buffer-n'ny Performance Booster alohan'ny hahalanian'ny habaka tabilao ao amin'ny tadidy. Azo atao amin'ny fomba roa izany: voalohany, ny fampihenana ny haben'ny tsanganana output ho amin'ny habe sahaza tsara. Ao amin'ny tabilao poller_output sy poller_output_boost izany tsanganana izany. Ny zavatra faharoa azonao atao dia ny manokana tadidy bebe kokoa ho an'ireo tabilao ao amin'ny tadidy. Nisafidy sanda atolotra 10%% amin'ny tadidin'ny rafitra izahay, saingy raha mampiasa kapila SSD ianao, na manana rafitra kely kokoa, dia azonao atao ny tsy miraharaha ity soso-kevitra ity na misafidy motera fitahirizana hafa. Azonao jerena ny fandaniana vinavinaina ho an'ireo tabilao Performance Booster ao amin'ny Console -> Fitaovan'ny Rafitra -> Hijery ny Satan'ny Boost."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 200 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 100000 can be used."
msgstr "Raha manana kapila SSD ianao dia ampiasao ity soso-kevitra ity. Raha manana kapila mafy ara-batana ianao dia ampiasao ny 200 * ny isan'ny kapila mavitrika ao amin'ny laharan-kapila. Raha mampiasa NVMe na PCIe Flash dia azo ampiasaina ny isa lehibe kokoa hatramin'ny 100000."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 2000 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 200000 can be used."
msgstr "Raha manana kapila SSD ianao dia ampiasao ity soso-kevitra ity. Raha manana kapila mafy ara-batana ianao dia ampiasao ny 2000 * ny isan'ny kapila mavitrika ao amin'ny laharan-kapila. Raha mampiasa NVMe na PCIe Flash dia azo ampiasaina ny isa lehibe kokoa hatramin'ny 200000."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion. Otherwise, do not set this setting."
msgstr "Raha manana kapila SSD ianao dia ampiasao ity soso-kevitra ity. Raha tsy izany, aza apetraka ity fikirana ity."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If your tables have very large indexes, you must operate with the Barracuda innodb_file_format and the innodb_large_prefix equal to 1.  Failure to do this may result in plugins that cannot properly create tables."
msgstr "Raha manana fanondro tena lehibe ny tabilaonao dia tsy maintsy miasa miaraka amin'ny innodb_file_format Barracuda sy ny innodb_large_prefix mitovy amin'ny 1 ianao. Raha tsy manao izany dia mety hiteraka plugin tsy afaka mamorona tabilao araka ny tokony ho izy."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "InnoDB will hold as many tables and indexes in system memory as is possible.  Therefore, you should make the innodb_buffer_pool large enough to hold as much of the tables and index in memory.  Checking the size of the /var/lib/mysql/cacti directory will help in determining this value.  We are recommending 25%% of your system's total memory, but your requirements will vary depending on your system's size."
msgstr "Ny InnoDB dia hitazona tabilao sy fanondro betsaka araka izay azo atao ao anaty fitadidian'ny rafitra. Noho izany, tokony hataonao lehibe ampy ny innodb_buffer_pool mba hitazonana ny ankamaroan'ny tabilao sy ny fanondro ao anaty fitadidiana. Ny fanamarinana ny haben'ny lahatahiry /var/lib/mysql/cacti dia hanampy amin'ny famaritana ity sanda ity. Manolotra 25%% amin'ny fitambaran'ny fitadidian'ny rafitrao izahay, saingy hiovaova arakaraka ny haben'ny rafitrao ny zavatra ilainao."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is STRONGLY recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.5.3."
msgstr "Amporisihina MAFY ny hampandehananao ny InnoDB amin'ny kinova %s rehetra mihoatra ny 5.5.3."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.1."
msgstr "Amporisihina ny hampandehananao ny InnoDB amin'ny kinova %s rehetra mihoatra ny 5.1."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Keeping the table cache larger means fewer file open/close operations when using innodb_file_per_table."
msgstr "Ny fihazonana ny tahiry vonjimaikan'ny tabilao ho lehibe kokoa dia midika ho vitsy kokoa ny fanokafana/fanakatonana rakitra rehefa mampiasa innodb_file_per_table."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum I/O performance happens when you use the O_DIRECT method to flush pages."
msgstr "Ny fahombiazana I/O ambony indrindra dia mitranga rehefa mampiasa ny fomba O_DIRECT ianao hanadiovana pejy."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "MySQL 5.6+ and MariaDB 10.0+ are great releases, and are very good versions to choose. Make sure you run the very latest release though which fixes a long standing low level networking issue that was causing spine many issues with reliability."
msgstr "Ny MySQL 5.6+ sy ny MariaDB 10.0+ dia kinova tena tsara sy azo isafidianana tsara. Ataovy azo antoka anefa fa ny kinova farany indrindra no ampiasainao satria manitsy olana ara-tambajotra ambany lenta efa ela izay niteraka olana maro momba ny fahatokisana ho an'ny Spine."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Note: Many changes below require a database restart"
msgstr "Fanamarihana: Maro amin'ireo fanovana eto ambany no mitaky famerenana mandefa ny angona"

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP %s is the minimum version"
msgstr "PHP %s no kinova farany ambany takiana"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Recommended Value"
msgstr "Sanda atolotra"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Rogue queries should not cause the database to go offline to others.  Kill these queries before they kill your system."
msgstr "Ny fangatahana manimba dia tsy tokony hanery ny angona ho tapaka ho an'ny hafa. Atsaharo ireo fangatahana ireo alohan'ny hanapotehany ny rafitrao."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Setting this value to 2 means that you will flush all transactions every second rather than at commit.  This allows %s to perform writing less often."
msgstr "Ny fametrahana ity sanda ity ho 2 dia midika fa hanadio ny fifanakalozana rehetra isan-tsegondra ianao fa tsy isaky ny fanamarinana. Izany dia mamela ny %s hanao fanoratana mahalana kokoa."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This is where metadata is stored. If you had a lot of tables, it would be useful to increase this."
msgstr "Eto no itahirizana ny metadata. Raha manana tabilao maro ianao dia ilaina ny mampitombo ity."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This setting should remain ON unless your Kadupul instance is running on either ZFS or FusionI/O which both have internal journaling to accommodate abrupt system crashes.  However, if you have very good power, and your systems rarely go down and you have backups, turning this setting to OFF can net you almost a 50% increase in database performance."
msgstr "Tokony hijanona ho ON ity fikirana ity raha tsy hoe mandeha amin'ny ZFS na FusionI/O ny rafitra Kadupul anao izay samy manana fitahirizam-panovana anatiny hiatrehana ny fahatapahan'ny rafitra tampoka. Na izany aza, raha manana famatsian-kery tsara dia tsara ianao, ary mahalana vao maty ny rafitrao sady manana tahiry fiarovana ianao, dia mety hitondra fiakarana hatramin'ny 50% amin'ny fahombiazan'ny angon-drakitra ny fametrahana ity fikirana ity ho OFF."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Miovaova"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When executing subqueries, having a larger temporary table size keeps those temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Rehefa manatanteraka fangatahana anatiny dia manampy amin'ny fitazonana ireo tabilao vonjimaika ireo ao anaty fitadidiana ny fananana habe lehibe kokoa ho an'ny tabilao vonjimaika."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When performing joins, if they are below this size, they will be kept in memory and never written to a temporary file.  As this is a per connection memory allocation, care must be taken not to increase it too high.  The sum of the join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Core MySQL/MariaDB memory should be below 80%.  If the recommendation is negative, you must decrease this and/or the sort_buffer_size until the recommendation fits within the allowable memory."
msgstr "Rehefa manao fampifandraisana tabilao, raha latsaky ity habe ity izy ireo dia ho tazonina ao anaty fitadidiana ary tsy hosoratana ao amin'ny rakitra vonjimaika mihitsy. Satria fitsinjarana fitadidiana isaky ny fifandraisana izany, dia tsy maintsy mitandrina mba tsy hampiakatra azy ho ambony loatra. Ny fitambaran'ny join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + fitadidiana fototra MySQL/MariaDB dia tokony ho latsaky ny 80%. Raha miiba ny soso-kevitra dia tsy maintsy ahenanao ity na/ary ny sort_buffer_size mandra-pahatongan'ny soso-kevitra ho antonona ao anatin'ny fitadidiana azo ampiasaina."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "When using InnoDB storage it is important to keep your table spaces separate.  This makes managing the tables simpler for long time users of %s.  If you are running with this currently off, you can migrate to the per file storage by enabling the feature, and then running an alter statement on all InnoDB tables."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa fitahirizana InnoDB dia zava-dehibe ny mitazona ny habaka tabilaonao ho misaraka. Manamora ny fitantanana ny tabilao ho an'ireo mpampiasa %s efa ela izany. Raha mandeha amin'ny fandrindrana maty amin'izao fotoana izao ianao, dia afaka mifindra amin'ny fitahirizana isaky ny rakitra ianao amin'ny alalan'ny fampandehanana ilay endri-javatra, ary avy eo mandefa baiko alter amin'ny tabilao InnoDB rehetra."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Kadupul with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4 character set as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa Kadupul amin'ny fiteny hafa ankoatra ny teny Anglisy, dia zava-dehibe ny fampiasana ny tahirin-tsoratra utf8mb4 satria ny litera sasany dia maka mihoatra ny iray byte."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Kadupul with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4_unicode_ci collation type as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa Kadupul amin'ny fiteny hafa ankoatra ny teny Anglisy, dia zava-dehibe ny fampiasana ny karazana collation utf8mb4_unicode_ci satria ny litera sasany dia maka mihoatra ny iray byte."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, this setting should be off if atomic writes are enabled.  Therefore, please enable atomic writes instead of the double write buffer as it will increase performance."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa MariaDB 10.2.4 sy ambony dia tokony ho maty ity fikirana ity raha mandeha ny fanoratana atômika. Noho izany, alefaso azafady ny fanoratana atômika fa tsy ny tahiry vonjimaika fanoratana indroa satria hampitombo ny fahombiazana izany."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, you can use atomic writes over the doublewrite buffer to increase performance."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa MariaDB 10.2.4 sy ambony dia azonao ampiasaina ny fanoratana atômika fa tsy ny tahiry vonjimaika fanoratana indroa mba hampitomboana ny fahombiazana."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using innodb_file_per_table, it is important to set the innodb_file_format to Barracuda.  This setting will allow longer indexes important for certain Kadupul tables."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa innodb_file_per_table, dia zava-dehibe ny fametrahana ny innodb_file_format ho Barracuda. Izany fikirana izany dia hamela fanondroana lava kokoa izay manan-danja ho an'ny tabilao Kadupul sasany."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With Remote polling capabilities, large amounts of data will be synced from the main server to the remote pollers.  Therefore, keep this value at or above 16M."
msgstr "Miaraka amin'ny fahaiza-manangona avy lavitra dia hisy rakitra maro be hampirindrina avy amin'ny mpizara fototra mankany amin'ireo mpanangona lavitra. Noho izany, tazomy ho 16M na mihoatra ity sanda ity."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Miaraka amin'ny fitahirizana karazana SSD maoderina, ny fananana kofehy io maro dia mahasoa ho an'ny rindranasa manana toetra io avo."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Miaraka amin'ny fitahirizana karazana SSD maoderina, ny fananana kofehy famakiana io maro dia mahasoa ho an'ny rindranasa manana toetra io avo."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Miaraka amin'ny fitahirizana karazana SSD maoderina, ny fananana kofehy famakiana io maro dia mahasoa ho an'ny rindranasa manana toetra io avo. Arakaraka ny kinova MariaDB/MySQL ampiasainao, ity sanda ity dia mety hahatratra hatramin'ny 64. Saingy miezaha mitazona ny isa ho latsaky ny fitambaran'ny kofehy SMT ao amin'ny mpizara angona."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Miaraka amin'ny fitahirizana karazana SSD maoderina, ny fananana kofehy fanoratana io maro dia mahasoa ho an'ny rindranasa manana toetra io avo."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Miaraka amin'ny fitahirizana karazana SSD maoderina, ny fananana kofehy fanoratana io maro dia mahasoa ho an'ny rindranasa manana toetra io avo. Arakaraka ny kinova MariaDB/MySQL ampiasainao, ity sanda ity dia mety hahatratra hatramin'ny 64. Saingy miezaha mitazona ny isa ho latsaky ny fitambaran'ny kofehy SMT ao amin'ny mpizara angona."

